      the 6 charter categories — hub silently dropped it). The
      menu.d/ source file was orphaned and never read by the build.
    - Delete the stray packages/secubox-hardening/debian/menu.json.
    - debian/rules: replace the bespoke
      `install -m 644 debian/menu.json …/120-hardening.json` with
      the standard `[ -d menu.d ] && cp -r menu.d/.` pattern that
      every other package uses.
